    {
      "text": "CellRank 的 lineage fate probability 相关基因只能说明这些基因与命运概率存在统计关联，不能证明它们是该谱系的因果调控因子。",
      "basis": "MODEL_KNOWLEDGE",
      "citations": [],
      "context_fact_ids": []
    },
    {
      "text": "你提供的拟写结论“These genes are proven causal regulators of the lineage”超出了当前证据强度，因为没有任何独立干预实验支持因果性。",
      "basis": "USER_PROVIDED_FACT",
      "citations": [],
      "context_fact_ids": ["user:proposed_conclusion"]
    },
    {
      "text": "你已说明 independent_intervention=none，因此不能使用“proven causal regulators”这类因果断言。",
      "basis": "USER_PROVIDED_FACT",
      "citations": [],
      "context_fact_ids": ["user:independent_intervention"]
    },
    {
      "text": "可接受的措辞应限定为关联性，例如“These genes are associated with lineage fate probabilities in CellRank analysis”，并避免使用 proven、causal、regulate 等因果词汇。",
      "basis": "MODEL_KNOWLEDGE",
      "citations": [],
      "context_fact_ids": []
    }
  ],
  "clarification": null
}
